### ChatApp API Test File
### Run these requests top-to-bottom in order.
### VS Code: install "REST Client" extension by Humao to run .http files.
### Visual Studio: built-in HTTP client supports this natively.

@host = https://localhost:7000

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. REGISTER — User A (Alice)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name registerAlice
POST {{host}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice@chat.com",
  "password": "Alice123!",
  "role": 0,
  "gender": 0
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. REGISTER — User B (Bob)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "email": "bob@chat.com",
  "password": "Bob123!",
  "role": 0,
  "gender": 0
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. VERIFY EMAIL
###    Copy the token printed in the response body from step 1 & 2
###    (in dev mode the token is returned in the response string)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@aliceToken = PASTE_ALICE_VERIFICATION_TOKEN_HERE
GET {{host}}/api/users/verify?token={{aliceToken}}

###

@bobToken = PASTE_BOB_VERIFICATION_TOKEN_HERE
GET {{host}}/api/users/verify?token={{bobToken}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. LOGIN — Alice  →  copy the "token" value into @aliceJwt
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name loginAlice
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@chat.com",
  "password": "Alice123!"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. LOGIN — Bob  →  copy the "token" value into @bobJwt
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name loginBob
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@chat.com",
  "password": "Bob123!"
}

###

### ── Paste your JWTs here after logging in ──────────────────────
@aliceJwt = PASTE_ALICE_JWT_HERE
@bobJwt   = PASTE_BOB_JWT_HERE

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. GET all users (no auth needed)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 7. CREATE a Chat Room  (Alice creates "General")
###    Alice is auto-joined as admin.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/chatroom
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceJwt}}

{
  "name": "General",
  "description": "General discussion"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 8. CREATE a second Chat Room  (Alice creates "Random")
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/chatroom
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceJwt}}

{
  "name": "Random",
  "description": "Off-topic chatter"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 9. GET all chat rooms (lists all rooms + member count)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/chatroom
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceJwt}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 10. GET Alice's rooms  (should show both rooms she created)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/chatroom/my
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceJwt}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 11. Bob JOINS room 1 (General)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/chatroom/1/join
Authorization: Bearer {{bobJwt}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 12. GET Bob's rooms  (should show "General")
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/chatroom/my
Authorization: Bearer {{bobJwt}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 13. Alice SENDS a message to room 1
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceJwt}}

{
  "chatRoomId": 1,
  "content": "Hey everyone! 👋"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 14. Bob SENDS a message to room 1
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bobJwt}}

{
  "chatRoomId": 1,
  "content": "Hi Alice! Great to be here 😄"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 15. GET messages in room 1  (paginated, newest first)
###     ?page=1&pageSize=50
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/message/1?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceJwt}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 16. DELETE a message  (sender or Admin only)
###     Replace {id} with an actual message ID from step 15
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{host}}/api/message/1
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceJwt}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 17. Bob TRIES to send to room 2 (Random) — should get 403
###     because Bob never joined "Random"
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bobJwt}}

{
  "chatRoomId": 2,
  "content": "Can I talk here?"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 18. Bob LEAVES room 1 (General)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{host}}/api/chatroom/1/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{bobJwt}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 19. GET room 1 details
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/chatroom/1
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceJwt}}

###
